config EXYNOS7885_BTS
	bool "Exynos7885/7904 bus traffic shaper"
	depends on ARCH_EXYNOS && OF
	help
	  Build the vendor Exynos7885 TREX QoS/arbitration driver and the
	  bandwidth API used by the Exynos7904 display controller. A matching
	  enabled DT node is required before any registers are accessed.

	  Samsung MIF/INT devfreq and display DVFS are not ported. Bandwidth
	  requirements are tracked, but do not change bus frequencies. This
	  driver alone therefore cannot guarantee display bandwidth.

config EXYNOS7885_BTS_VM
	bool "Exynos7885 BTS VM arbitration policy"
	depends on EXYNOS7885_BTS
	help
	  Select the vendor VM ABOX priority and DREX QoS-7 timeout rather
	  than the default policy. Leave disabled for the stock M20 policy.
